            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Huge update coming Spring 2027</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLASH THE BEATS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in and get moving! Slash, duck, and dodge your way through every beat. Match the color and direction of incoming notes to master the music and keep your body in the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/ed569c5010531c5d795627a2299a65e6.poster.avif?t=1793008842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/ed569c5010531c5d795627a2299a65e6.webm?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/ed569c5010531c5d795627a2299a65e6.mp4?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILT FOR THE BEAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is handcrafted to perfectly match the music. Experience stunning visual effects and haptic feedback that put you inside the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/6fdf086f59bf42ffffc8e447c73c44ff.poster.avif?t=1793008842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/6fdf086f59bf42ffffc8e447c73c44ff.webm?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/6fdf086f59bf42ffffc8e447c73c44ff.mp4?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN UNBEATABLE MUSIC LIBRARY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat Saber features a massive library of 300+ songs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Now:</strong> Get 60+ free songs included with the base game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Collection:</strong> 239+ songs from artists like Coldplay, Imagine Dragons, and Metallica. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always Fresh:</strong> New songs releasing in Music Packs and Shock Drops throughout the year! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/d4d528671d67a59caabd5f3d54a1fa6f.poster.avif?t=1793008842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/d4d528671d67a59caabd5f3d54a1fa6f.webm?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/d4d528671d67a59caabd5f3d54a1fa6f.mp4?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE WAYS TO PLAY</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo:</strong> Pick a track, choose your difficulty, and lose yourself in the music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party:</strong> Pass the headset, and see who tops the leaderboard. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign:</strong> Sharpen your skills by completing unique objectives and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online:</strong> Challenge friends or join up to 5-player cross-play matches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/34cd5b80d96317cf3e8ceec7f15b104d.poster.avif?t=1793008842\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/34cd5b80d96317cf3e8ceec7f15b104d.webm?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620980/extras/34cd5b80d96317cf3e8ceec7f15b104d.mp4?t=1793008842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MADE FOR EVERYONE. MASTERED BY FEW.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Rise up the ranks and become a world-renowned Beat Saberist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Accessibility:</strong> Play your way with 5 difficulty levels, 15 gameplay modifiers, custom environment colors and more. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*See Stats URL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Downloads Not Rated by the ESRB </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUSIC DOWNLOADS NOT RATED BY PEGI </p>",
